If you're playing UnNetHack 3.5.1, there's a bug where randomly placed
monsters specified in the level des file might be placed in walls. But
for 3.5.2 this should be fixed.

> I killed the blue jelly and saw this.
>
> http://imgur.com/49bne.jpg

This is normal behavior even for vanilla NetHack.

Corpses are not generated on walls, ironbars, lava pools, etc (what's
an acceptable place is determined by the function accessible() in
src/monmove.c.

> What happened with a blue jelly being placed on a wall?

If it's not a bug, my guess would be a chameleon polymorphed into a
phasing monster like a Xorn and then polymorphing on the wall into a
blue jelly.

